%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian (Web UI)
    participant UI as Web UI (React)
    participant API as Youth Account API (Spring Boot)
    participant Auth as OAuth2 Auth Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Ledger as Transaction Ledger
    participant DB as Account DB
    participant Settings as Settings DB

    %% Dashboard Retrieval
    Parent->>UI: Login & view dashboard
    UI->>Auth: Request OAuth2 token
    Auth-->>UI: OAuth2 token (JWT)
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (Bearer token)
    API->>DB: Fetch youth account
    API->>Settings: Fetch spending limit
    API->>Ledger: Fetch recent transactions
    DB-->>API: Account details
    Settings-->>API: Spending limit
    Ledger-->>API: Recent transactions
    API-->>UI: Dashboard data (balance, limit, txns)
    UI-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer (Bearer token, amount)
    API->>Payment: Initiate fund transfer
    Payment-->>API: Transfer status
    API->>DB: Update account balance
    DB-->>API: Updated balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer result
    UI-->>Parent: Show transfer status

    %% Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>UI: Set spending limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit (Bearer, limit)
    API->>Settings: Update spending limit
    Settings-->>API: Confirmation
    API-->>UI: Limit updated
    UI-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% View Transaction History
    Parent->>UI: View transactions
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions (Bearer, filters)
    API->>Ledger: Fetch transactions
    Ledger-->>API: Transaction list
    API-->>UI: Transactions data
    UI-->>Parent: Show transaction history
